  frozen-render  : the recorded RESPONSE can be re-rendered to compare payload/coverage
                   without re-executing. Needs a parseable ranked payload in the result.
  neither        : cannot be replayed at either fidelity.

Tiers are reported separately and never summed into a single "replayable" count.
