<section class="part" id="misses">
  <h2>5. What study 6 missed, and why</h2>
  <p class="kicker">All 77 targets the newest build failed to show at 4 KiB, classified by cause. Post-hoc diagnosis: it doesn't change study 6's result.</p>
  <div class="tablewrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Cause</th><th>Misses</th><th>What it means</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Right file, other symbol ranked</td><td class="num">51</td><td>The file was found but a different symbol in it outranked the target.</td><td>Ranking work (F1/F2 below)</td></tr>
