      <tr><td>Nested inside another symbol</td><td class="num">2</td><td>The target sits inside a bigger symbol's region.</td><td>Ranking work</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Merged span dropped the declaration</td><td class="num">4</td><td>Neighbouring hits merged; the absorbed declaration was optional and got dropped under budget.</td><td>Deliberate size policy; a trade-off for you</td></tr>
