- the environment allowlist in `pilot-env.sh` and `pilot-inner.sh`, which needs the new budget variable;
- the stage table in `run_stage.sh`;
- the seal (stage, namespace and spend threshold), the stage manifest writer, the cohort order and the runbook blocks;
